# Normalise text files to LF so gofmt/goimports behave identically on the
# Linux CI runners and on Windows checkouts (core.autocrlf otherwise injects
# CRLF locally and makes gofmt report the whole tree as changed).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Treat media and font assets as binary.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
